 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Added
+
+- `parse` accepts days (`2d4h`), a fixed 24-hour unit.
+- `format(ms, { days: true })` shows days (`1d 2h`). Without the option the
+  output is unchanged.
+
 ## [1.4.0] - 2026-06-02
 
 ### Added
